 to store alongside the downloaded resources."}]}],"name":"context"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The completion handler to call once the pack has been added."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This handler is executed asynchronously on the main queue."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"completion"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/ManageOfflineRegionsExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/OfflinePackExample"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The resulting pack is added to the shared offline storage object’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"packs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"property, then the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"completion"},{"type":"text","text":" block is executed with that pack passed in."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The pack has an initial state of "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackState\/MLNOfflinePackStateInactive","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":". To begin"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"downloading resources, call "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack\/resume","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" on the pack from within"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the completion handler. To monitor download progress, add an observer for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackProgressChangedNotification","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"s about that pack."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To detect when any call to this method results in a new pack, observe KVO"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change notifications on the shared offline storage object’s "},{"code":"packs","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" key path."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Additions to that array result in an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSKeyValueChangeInsertion"},{"type":"text","text":" change."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinestorage\/addpackforregion:withcontext:completionhandler:"]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"addPackForRegion:withContext:completionHandler:"}],"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNOfflineStorage(im)addPackForRegion:withContext:completionHandler:","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"title":"addPackForRegion:withContext:completionHandler:","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"addPackForRegion:withContext:completionHandler:","kind":"identifier"}]},"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflinePackState/MLNOfflinePackStateInactive":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackState\/MLNOfflinePackStateInactive","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinepackstate\/mlnofflinepackstateinactive","title":"MLNOfflinePackStateInactive","abstract":[{"text":"The pack is incomplete and is not currently downloading.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNOfflinePackStateInactive"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflinePack/resume":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack\/resume","title":"resume","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinepack\/resume","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resume","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Resumes downloading if the pack is inactive."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflinePackProgressChangedNotification":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackProgressChangedNotification","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Posted by the shared "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage"},{"type":"text","text":" object when an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"object’s progress changes. The progress may change due to a resource being"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"downloaded or because the pack discovers during the download that more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resources are required for offline viewing. This notification is posted"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whenever any field in the "},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property changes."}],"title":"MLNOfflinePackProgressChangedNotification","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNOfflinePackProgressChangedNotification"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinepackprogresschangednotification"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflineStorage/addPackForRegion:withContext:completionHandler:":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage\/addPackForRegion:withContext:completionHandler:","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates and registers an offline pack that downloads the resources needed to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use the given region offline."}],"title":"addPackForRegion:withContext:completionHandler:","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"addPackForRegion:withContext:completionHandler:"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinestorage\/addpackforregion:withcontext:completionhandler:"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","title":"MapLibre","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflineStorage":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"MLNOfflineStorage","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"MLNOfflineStorage implements a singleton (shared object) that manages offline"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"packs and ambient caching. All of this class’s instance methods are asynchronous,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reflecting the fact that offline resources are stored in a database. The shared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"object maintains a canonical collection of offline packs in its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"packs"},{"type":"text","text":" property."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNOfflineStorage"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinestorage"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/ManageOfflineRegionsExample":{"type":"topic","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/ManageOfflineRegionsExample","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Query, delete and download offline regions"}],"title":"Manage Offline Regions","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/map